## قواعد الاختبار

### 1. اختبار Cubit

**لاختبار الحالة:**
```dart
test('should emit loaded state when data is loaded', () async {
  // Arrange
  when(() => mockRepository.getData()).thenAnswer((_) async => mockData);
  
  // Act
  cubit.loadData();
  
  // Assert
  expect(cubit.state, MyState.loaded(mockData));
});
```

### 2. اختبار Widget

**لاختبار الواجهة:**
```dart
testWidgets('should display user name', (tester) async {
  // Arrange
  final user = User(name: 'John Doe');
  
  // Act
  await tester.pumpWidget(MyWidget(user: user));
  
  // Assert
  expect(find.text('John Doe'), findsOneWidget);
});
```

